{"id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md","title":"Dedekind Cut","display":"df-dedekind-cut — Dedekind Cut","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dedekind-cut","aliases":["58-df-dedekind-cut","58-df-dedekind","58-df-dedekindcut","Dedekind Cut"],"display":"df-dedekind-cut — Dedekind Cut","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dedekind-cut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dedekind-cut</span><span>58-df-dedekind</span><span>58-df-dedekindcut</span><span>Dedekind Cut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dedekind-cut — Dedekind Cut"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>（有理数有序域，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DedekindCut}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{DedekindCut}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（单侧 Dedekind 切谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（双侧分割形式的兼容谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb Q)\\)</span>（由全部单侧切构成的集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_D\">\\(\\mathbb R_D\\)</span>（以 Dedekind 切构造的实数集合）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut} \\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subsetneq\\mathbb Q\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall p\\in A\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(q&lt;p\\to q\\in A)\\land\\forall p\\in A\\;\\exists q\\in A\\;(p&lt;q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut} \\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subsetneq\\mathbb Q\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall p\\in A\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(q&lt;p\\to q\\in A)\\land\\forall p\\in A\\;\\exists q\\in A\\;(p&lt;q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut\\text{-}pair}\\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\land B=\\mathbb Q\\setminus A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut\\text{-}pair}\\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\land B=\\mathbb Q\\setminus A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash \\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb Q):\\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\}\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathbb R_D\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash \\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb Q):\\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\}\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathbb R_D\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>单侧定义要求下闭、非空、真子集且没有最大元；双侧形式由补集唯一恢复。</li>\n<li>构造阶段不能用“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\sup A\">\\(r=\\sup A\\)</span>”定义切，因为上确界所在的实数系正是待构造对象。</li>\n<li>本文件不再依赖 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83855da2e0a85ce3\" href=\"?note=83855da2e0a85ce3\" title=\"58-df-real-number\">58-df-real-number</a>；后者可安全地以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\)</span> 定义实数，从而消除循环。</li>\n<li><code>58-df-dedekind</code> 和 <code>58-df-dedekindcut</code> 的旧标签合并于此。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Hewitt and Stromberg, Real and Abstract Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$（有理数有序域，见 [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-real-number","status":"resolved","id":"83855da2e0a85ce3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件不再依赖 [[58-df-real-number]]；后者可安全地以 $\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)$ 定义实数，从而消除循环。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DedekindCut}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut} \\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subsetneq\\mathbb Q\\land A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall p\\in A\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(q<p\\to q\\in A)\\land\\forall p\\in A\\;\\exists q\\in A\\;(p<q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut\\text{-}pair}\\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\land B=\\mathbb Q\\setminus A","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}cut\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash \\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb Q):\\mathrm{DedekindCut}(A)\\}\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathbb R_D\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)","display":true},{"tex":"r=\\sup A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)","display":false}],"bytes":1951,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e49ef470c93837f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DedekindCut}_S(A,B)$ and $\\mathbb R_D=\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)$ are from [[../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]."},{"id":"1746581a68e233ce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"83855da2e0a85ce3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DedekindCuts}(\\mathbb Q)$（见 [[../batch17/58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]）"},{"id":"aa16587cad992289","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f8b230bf5d6a0f44","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"307